<title>INDIA: India Sanghi Poly 95/96 net falls 67 pct.</title>
<headline>India Sanghi Poly 95/96 net falls 67 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     126.75   vs     381.52</p>
<p>    Sales		  4,380.63   vs   3,563.16</p>
<p>    Other income	    79.67   vs	79.83</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  3,872.59   vs   2,930.68</p>
<p>    Interest		 305.28   vs     202.65</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   282.44   vs     509.66</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   155.69   vs     128.15</p>
<p>    Tax			 nil     vs	nil</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	  0.50   vs	 1.20</p>
<p>Note: Sanghi Polyesters, a south-India based polyester filament yarn manufacturer, said higher input costs and lower sales realisations hit working. -- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
